Quick facts / assumptions
- Filing status: Married filing jointly (MFJ).
- Income you reported: W‑2 $79,400; self‑employed graphic design gross $11,200; interest/dividends $1,780 (Citi) + $195 (E*TRADE) = $1,975.
- Business expenses you reported: $780 (assumed ordinary business expenses).
