4. Do you prefer the simplified home-office method or want me to use the actual expenses (we already have rent, which makes actual-expense favorable)?

Next steps I can do for you
- If you want, I can run the line-by-line math using the actual-expense home-office method (and including $780 as business expenses if you confirm), show the resulting AGI, taxable income under both itemize vs standard, and estimate federal income tax + self-employment tax.
