- Schedule SE — self‑employment tax calculation  
- Form 8829 — if you use the actual‑expense method for business use of home (if simplified method, do not use 8829)  
- Schedule A — only if you itemize (charitable contributions, SALT, etc.) — otherwise you take the $29,200 standard deduction  
