9) Other items and planning tips
- Estimated taxes: Because you have self‑employment income, you owe self‑employment tax and possibly additional income tax. If tax isn’t fully covered by W‑2 withholding, make estimated tax payments (Form 1040‑ES) to avoid penalties.  
- California state tax: California rules differ in places from federal (e.g., itemized deductions, student loan interest, etc.). Check CA rules or ask a CA tax pro. The SALT $10,000 federal cap does not affect your California itemized deductions for state purposes.  
